# Phase 2
DATABASE_PATH=./data/app.sqlite   # SQLite database built by `npm run db:import` (git-ignored)

# Phase 7 — shopping assistant (ALL OPTIONAL; server-side only; never commit real values)
# PHASE 9 LOCK: any AGENT_PROVIDER=openai-compatible request is LOCKED in code (LIVE_MODEL_CALLS_ENABLED_IN_CODE=false): no request is ever sent and the
# assistant answers 503 AGENT_LIVE_LOCKED — env vars cannot enable it. Phase 10 needs the owner approval + AGENT_LIVE_APPROVAL/caps listed in docs/phase-10-live-trial-plan.md.
# AGENT_PROVIDER=mock               # mock (default: deterministic offline planner, NOT a language model) | openai-compatible | disabled
# AGENT_MODEL=                      # model name for the openai-compatible adapter (required with it)
# AGENT_BASE_URL=                   # https base URL of an OpenAI-compatible endpoint, e.g. https://example.com/v1 (required with it)
AGENT_API_KEY=
# A complete openai-compatible configuration is NOT proof of a working live call: it stays "NOT LIVE VERIFIED" until a human runs the documented live check and approves its cost.
# AGENT_EVIDENCE_MODE=off           # off (default) | fixture (QA/demo: synthetic labelled records) | live (needs AGENT_EXTERNAL_LIVE=1 and a reviewed adapter registry)
# AGENT_EVIDENCE_REPRODUCE=0        # 0 (default) = third-party review pages are LINK-ONLY (no fetch, no reproduced text; rights unclear). 1 = owner opt-in after a rights review
# AGENT_EXTERNAL_LIVE=              # set to 1 ONLY after reviewing the allowlisted adapters
# AGENT_RATE_PER_MIN=30  AGENT_MAX_CONCURRENT=4  AGENT_MAX_HOPS=6  AGENT_PROVIDER_TIMEOUT_MS=20000

# --- Phase 10A (all optional) ---
# TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS=1     # ONLY behind a reverse proxy that OVERWRITES X-Forwarded-For; otherwise every client shares one rate-limit bucket (spoof-proof)
# API_POST_RATE_PER_MIN=120 # /api/sellers and /api/compare/sellers POST, per process (single instance assumed)
# CSP_STRICT_STYLES=1       # opt-in: <style> needs the nonce; only style ATTRIBUTES stay inline. Measured on Chromium only.
# Live-trial handshake variables exist (AGENT_LIVE_*) but the model path is CODE-LOCKED; see docs/live-ai-trial-runbook.md. Do not set them.
